        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-fem-lobe-action-potential-conduction-velocity-from-trigger-hair-across-dionaea-lobe-planform>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-forterre-venus-flytrap-snap-buckling-measurement-flat-pass-gaussian-stretching-energy-barrier-u-stretch-0-0-at-adult-alpha-3-0>,
